1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,600
Using ChatGPT Plus for long tasks? Give your agent a sense of time with QuotaGuard.

2
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:13,322
Ten percent left means something different when reset is two hours away, or just fifteen minutes away.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,784
QuotaGuard divides remaining quota by hours until reset.

4
00:00:17,784 --> 00:00:22,040
That gives five, or forty, percentage points per hour.

5
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:28,876
A twelve point reference guides four pacing levels: tight, conservative, comfortable, and abundant.

6
00:00:29,542 --> 00:00:32,302
Keep weekly limits in view.

7
00:00:32,302 --> 00:00:33,958
Preserve essential checks.

8
00:00:33,958 --> 00:00:36,718
Save a concrete next step.

9
00:00:36,718 --> 00:00:39,478
No extra quota is promised.

10
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:46,303
Install the skill, then ask QuotaGuard to check your budget and plan the work.

11
00:00:46,303 --> 00:00:47,180
Open source.

12
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,495
Built for Plus.
